/target
**/target

# The build-script refresh sentinel, which belongs to the two cabinet-sourced providers. Never
# committed: a git dependency is a checkout of this repository, so a committed sentinel would put
# every consumer's build on the refresh path. Create it in a working tree (`touch
# certval_stores_msft/refresh-inputs`, `touch certval_stores_tpm/refresh-inputs`) to let `cargo
# build` re-fetch the cabinet and regenerate. The InstallRoot providers are refreshed by
# `certval-store-gen refresh` instead.
refresh-inputs
